 <h3><u>Padar zinda hai akbar</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haye,&nbsp; haye..<br> Padar zinda hai akbar..(2)<br> tum hogaye bejaan, padar zinda hai akbar..(2)</p> 
  <p>Aisa bhi zamane mein kahi'n hota hai akbar<br> tum hogaye bejaan, padar zinda hai akbar..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Maqtal se janaze ko tere kaise uthayein<br> jin haatho'n se mangi tere jeene ki duaein<br> un haatho'n pe ab haaye tera laasha hai akbar</p> 
  <p>tum hogaye bejaan, padar zinda hai akbar..(2)</p> 
  <p>2. Dil apna sambhalu'n to sina dil se nikalu<br> phir kaampte haatho'n se tera laasha uthalu<br> kis haal mein dekho to tera baba hai akbar</p> 
  <p>tum hogaye bejaan, padar zinda hai akbar..(2)</p> 
  <p>3. Tum aankhein phira lete ho jab dard ke maare<br> jab saans nahi lete ho haatho'n pe hamare<br> dum saath mein mera bhi nikal jaata hai akbar</p> 
  <p>tum hogaye bejaan, padar zinda hai akbar..(2)</p> 
  <p>4. Socha tha tumhe shaan se hum dulha banate..(2)<br> afsos magar laash pe hain aansoo bahate<br> ab khoon ka maathe pe tere sehra hai akbar</p> 
  <p>tum hogaye bejaan, padar zinda hai akbar..(2)</p> 
  <p>5. Chut ta hai zaeefi mein jo bete ka sahara<br> ab saath nahi deti hai beenayi hamara<br> uth-ta hai padar aur kabhi girta hai akbar</p> 
  <p>tum hogaye bejaan, padar zinda hai akbar..(2)</p> 
  <p>6. Zainab ko tera haal ye dikhlau to kaise<br> mai apne gale se tujhe liptau to kaise<br> lipta hua barchi mein tera seena hai akbar</p> 
  <p>tum hogaye bejaan, padar zinda hai akbar..(2)</p> 
  <p>7. Nauha Ali akbar ka hai meesum ki zabani<br> aakho'n se raza hoti hai ashko ki rawani<br> ehsaas tere ghum ka badha jaata hai akbar</p> 
  <p>tum hogaye bejaan, padar zinda hai akbar..(2)</p> 
